  "title": "07 · Dispatching a carton to a chosen company",
  "description": "Manufacturer → Scan → scan the carton → Dispatch → choose the warehouse. The expected arrival time appears.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "How to show it",
      "description": "## Dispatching a carton to a chosen company\n\n**How to show it in the app**\n\nManufacturer → Scan → scan the carton → Dispatch → choose the warehouse. The expected arrival time appears."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/record.ts",
